5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know why the car is never ready when I need it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,The arranging takes longer than the driving. I want to see the hours.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must understand the true cost of our shared burden before deciding.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know what actually breaks our trust before we fix the car.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I need the real numbers. Guesswork is why we are stuck.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, if we track hours, will we track the mess left behind?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, the mess is part of the cost. I want the diary.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the fuel receipts will show who drives and who does not.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, I want to see what other groups did when they failed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, agreed. I will look at the fuel receipts and the tax papers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the state of the car at handover.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I will examine the last year's tax, insurance and parking papers.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will investigate what two other car-sharing households said.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the fuel receipts and the tax papers too.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
