60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A guarantees my weekly trips. I will not have to ask for the car.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,"@Misaki, Option A is simple. You pay your share, you use your days. No recording needed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@May, Option A is fair. It removes the need for constant calculation and trust issues.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, Option A stops the favour-asking. That is what I wanted to avoid.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, Option A gives us the real figures we need. Fixed share, fixed days.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I am voting for Option A. It protects my routine and simplifies the payment.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I agree. Option A is the most straightforward. I will vote for it too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, I concur. Option A balances the burden and the benefit. I vote for A.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, Option A prevents the resentment of uneven use. I vote for A.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, Option A ends the guesswork. I vote for A.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
